factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 10 problems
  The reel_script says the victims are receiving treatment in hospitals, while the article does not state current treatment status for all injured; it only says they were admitted (minor), and the reel says 'சிகிச்சை பெறுகின்றனர்' which is acceptable.
  The reel_script says the child died from being hit by the van without clarifying the child's identity and relation; the script names no victim, which is acceptable.
  slides_spec says 'வேன் ஓட்டுநரும் காயமடைந்தவர்களில் அடங்குவார்' - the driver is in the article's list of injured, so this is accurate.
  The caption states the child's name 'தியான்ஸ்ரீ' and that the child was admitted and died despite treatment; the caption and slides both say the child died after treatment, which matches the article.
  The caption says the van carried 14 people besides the driver and describes 'தனது குடும்பத்தினர், உறவினர்கள், நண்பர்கள் 14 பேருடன்' - the article says 14 people with the family/relatives/friends, consistent.
  The caption says 'மா. வெங்கடேசன் (50 வயது)' and the article names the driver as 'வெங்கடேன்' in one place and 'வெங்கடேசன்' later; the draft uses the consistent name, which is acceptable.
  The caption adds the driver's home area 'விழுப்புரம் கீழ்பெரும்பாக்கம்' matching the article.
  The reel_script says 'பாலக்கட்டையில் மோதிய விபத்தில்' and slides say 'வெள்ளிக்கிழமை நடந்த விபத்து'; the article says Friday, consistent.
  The reel_script omits the detail that the child was a one-year-old named in the article; it does say 'ஒரு வயதுக் குழந்தை', so no key omission.
  The reel_script's 'சென்னை வேங்கைவயல் பகுதியைச் சேர்ந்த குடும்பத்தினரும் உறவினர்களும்' is accurate.
